title: The AI & Computing Encyclopedia
message: If you use this encyclopedia, please cite it.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: The AI & Computing Encyclopedia contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/Iamhifza/encyclopedia
url: https://Iamhifza.github.io/encyclopedia
abstract: >-
  A structured, continuously reviewed knowledge base of AI and computing
  concepts. Each concept has one canonical entry with typed relationships,
  historical lineage, comparisons and primary sources, published as a website
  and as a JSON API.
